{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_09_end","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_09","title":"岁相","storyCode":"IW-9","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"cdb0d11a400d130f3ada8239726b6a8095fcd2d68fcda16f1de28b5db0e1e493","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"酒盏是某人落下的一枚黑子，在对方的布置下，岁相降临，姐妹三人必须齐心协力，战胜自我。另一面幻境之中，众人合战天人。唯有心境澄清我是我，才能脱身。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"07上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g01_yanstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？在打雷吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逛街的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像山那头在打雷啊，最近的天气是怎么了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逛街的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？山上是不是有什么东西......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这谁看得清啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在这里，待了有两三日了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是再找不到出去的办法，岂不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"静待即可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......指不定哪天外头那位夕小姐心情好，就把咱们放出去了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，那位挑夫老先生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他儿子葬在山上，他不想在这种地方和我碰面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位的恩怨我也听说了......只是......一定要以这种方式做个了断吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就莫要觉得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旁人总以为自己什么都看得明白，但人与人之间的共情终归是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心里也清楚怎么做才对，什么叫“有必要”什么叫“没有必要”。大道理嘛，谁都懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是偶尔，人情还是不讲道理的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......下雨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我们就这么干等着，也不是个事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不然各位也试试养一只墨魉？我发现这小东西，你心平气和待它，它还挺可爱的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......由此可见，司岁台警戒其人，不无道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，在这里争这个也没啥意义......不然还是进屋避雨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这地儿也会下雨，稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掉下来的居然不是墨水，确实稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合先生？真不进来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那慎师傅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎师傅在做什么？刚才开始，他就低头看着手心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在看雨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听乌有所说，这一方天地，不过是那人画卷之物。处处雕琢，栩栩如生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日出时，羽出山林，雾蒙大地，见天光而不见大日，映影楼层千百栋，悄无声息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是画，不知道这个画家，究竟从大炎山水之中，看到了什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨师好雅兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只知道浮萍雨师慎楼曾从军十载，殊不知还略通文采风骚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。日子过多了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，早春的雨水，不该是这个温度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去，破开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雨师高明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是误打误撞罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚冢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这就是，你们要争抢那只酒盏的目的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山上云海翻滚，那里又有什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“岁相”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（无言的轰鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，我有点烦躁起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......比起我独见岁相，似乎确实强硬些许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是体态巍峨，有其形，终究不得其神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们还在这儿，它谈得上什么“神”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多半是用了与那酒盏类似的手段，只不过反其道而行之，得到了几分形似罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有形无神，终究只是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“岁相”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（无言的轰鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么呀，你这不是挺怕的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你说什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么有形无神的，我总觉得你在骂我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在它暂时被拘押在这座凉亭之内，只是再让它闹腾一会......就不好说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦啊，这可不是用个爆竹就能对付的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不继续努力了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真不出力啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“岁相”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（无言的轰鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你怕的原来是这个啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小夕啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别那么喊我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你都有点发抖了，没问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的好妹妹可是因为害怕眼前这个影子，在自己的画里躲藏了百年不曾闭眼，这会儿怯场也是理所当然的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别把事情说得那么轻描淡写......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是个影子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准确来说，是我们三人的影子，四分之一个岁的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它可是我们啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“岁相”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘲弄的笑声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，翻弄我的画，你在嘲笑我吗！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我建议你这会儿还是不要胡思乱想比较好。刚才这家伙已经锻出过我自己都没想好的第七种武器了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是做个深呼吸吧，省得下次我们都要被你关在画里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——画？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发现了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道法自然，大道至简。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岁原本哪有这么多花样。说到底，眼前巨大岁相，不过是你我内心深处的镜花水月罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......岁月悠悠，它变了不少。它快要疯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它已经疯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，此刻，我们就像它的一个梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它醒过来，我们就要一起完蛋，不光我们完蛋，大炎也要跟着遭殃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小年啊，所以你想反抗它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你一定有一个颇具风雅的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这我可说不准，我只能说比坐以待毙要好得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为我不服气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很不服气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是被她拖着而已......也许有那么一点期待吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少废话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......方才我问你，关于我们的下场，你回答说，“不知道”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个答案确实算不得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞧，你们还是你们，有你们自己的想法，自己的喜怒哀乐，自己热爱的事物，中意的人，留恋的风景......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活在这天下，不是挺好的吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管它作甚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们和它难道毫无干系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我是我，与它何干？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人间已醉万年，还不许我大梦一场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的答案呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——“无所谓”。"},{"type":"narration","text":"仰头饮酒。\n尾如笔，墨如影。\n风起弹剑。\n雨过濯缨。\n权倾浊酒澄吾心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下棋？什么棋，我可不太懂棋道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎围棋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太复杂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如五子棋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儿戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得没差。你喜欢下棋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不喜欢。下棋很无趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你是个棋痴，除了吃饭就知道下棋的那种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棋盘双方遵循着同一种规则，在纵横间黑白厮杀，有什么意义呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棋，终归只是一种游戏罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你为何要找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吾与吾斗，太过无聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是......我们刚才不是还在山脚下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有这种能耐的，只有他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请宁小姐跟紧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的屋里......似乎有光亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这人，下棋不讲章法啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下棋可就真是为难我了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......略懂而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不急，不急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一局......我等了很多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你赢我一个门外汉，又能怎么样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该等你的帮手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老鲤？你为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵！？呃，还有宁小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......见过宁侍郎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然有很多事想询问秉烛人，不过似乎不该是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（侍郎！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请坐，请坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此一来，便差不多了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与各位下一盘棋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不喜欢下棋，却要拉着这么多人陪你下棋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这只酒盏可害我不浅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果最后那位小姐没有替我点破真相......我会变成什么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不准，也许你某次醒来，会发现自己才是那个梦幻泡影。泡沫一碎，睁开眼的人，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也太可怕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你倒是没有什么情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都说了可怕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......我就当是这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵挑你入局真的是个偶然，也许你们都是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，天底下固然有无数个偶然，可唯独你不是那个偶然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有个人，他姓槐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情变了，好像只有在提及你的朋友时，你才会流露出那么点可有可无的认真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，该你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得提醒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一着不慎，满盘皆输。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生是怎么逃脱的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想了许久许久，想明白了一个道理罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如何应劫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这局棋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"论棋道，本就没几个人比得过先生，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活得久些罢了。再久，就无趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐这一手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别多想。"},{"type":"narration","text":"啪。\n白子拍在棋盘上。\n胜负显而易见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我前几手太乱来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这局棋意味着什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏而已，别多想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很难不多想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先想胜负吧，轮到你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......局势已经很清楚了，你不必故弄玄虚下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要认输，其余人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，这局棋的意义，并不在这棋盘之上。"},{"type":"narration","text":"啪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我胜负，应当不在这一角才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对付故弄玄虚的家伙，最好的办法，就是陪着他装疯卖傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不擅长下棋，倒是擅长......察言观色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......回答你方才那个问题，年轻的秉烛人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经有一场变故，我失去了一位......妹妹。你虽然年轻，但既然职责在此，想必明白我说的是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是可以在这里谈论的话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实如此，还请先生慎言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，我那小小居所的棋篓里，就少了一枚黑子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......在那场变故中，弄坏了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，我就一直在想。在想我该做什么，我又能做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当朝太傅......我第一眼见到他的时候，他还只是个穷学生，被他那个德高望重的老先生领着，走过停滞的城市，望向那高高的宫墙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没法自由行动，你不该见过太傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是个有趣的人。他有句话，说到了我心坎里。在我也对这些冰冷的云子感到厌倦的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像很无聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百无聊赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"鲤的身后此刻有很多人。\n朋友，伙伴，刚认识的大官，暂时的对手。\n可老鲤仍旧看不清眼前这个人。这个假借自己形象出现的人。\n他面目模糊。\n模糊到让人脊背生寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......再一手，就算我再怎么不通棋术也看得出，你早该赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你我认可了同样的规则，棋盘上又哪有什么输赢呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可有些诡辩了，你得向天下那么多名手道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，总之，被你带在身边的日子很愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这局棋是你赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们似乎还没有下完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是小瞧了我的......妹妹们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的棋局也没什么意义了，就当我投子认输罢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你是个很不服输的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......对，是我输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你，名叫克洛丝的卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年选中罗德岛是别有用心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望你用一个褒义词去形容年和我们的关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......无妨，你想怎么理解就怎么理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们已经没法置身事外了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是被小夕看见你这拙劣的园子，估计要气得不轻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听语气，你不欢迎我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让这么一大群人围在你周围陪你手谈对弈，怎么，寂寞久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看破了那个迷障，若非如此，年和夕一定胜不过它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你猜到了......克洛丝，让一让，让我离我的兄弟更近一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这么说来......她是什么时候记住我们名字的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你执黑，谁执白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身铸云子，博弈苍生，不胜不休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是因为颉的消失？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已投子认输，各位不必久留。只是，令，我送你一份小礼，你还未曾察觉。等你收下后，再来找我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与此事无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只怪这人间，无趣极了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......继续吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闲居在那古怪地方的时候，你在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想挑个趁手的棍棒，没找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们还要打吗！？都歇息那么久了，就不能消消气吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大块头！慎师傅！你们倒是劝两句啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山顶有异，就说明梁大人交代的事，还是成真了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岁相显现，大事优先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也得上山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就请吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......你们真不听我一句劝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！山头发生什么了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——当心头顶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"落石滚滚。\n郑清钺挥动了刀。\n若是二十年前——不，十年前，郑清钺都有自信，能把这块脑袋大的山岩一分为二，不沾尘土。\n可他还是老了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——夜儿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老是老了，孩子也大了。\n郑清钺没有多想，他的女儿为了救他而被山岩砸中，坠落山崖，可他也没有丝毫犹豫，飞身跳下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌柜的！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂、喂！你要做什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——怎么他也跟着跳下去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慎楼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，我下去找，你先上去！在山顶看见什么都不要轻举妄动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......怎么......夜儿！夜儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还好，只是晕过去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是我在最后关头借力打力，你们两个早就摔死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚冢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一次，郑清钺，又一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年你护不住我的儿子，护不住杜遥夜的父亲，护不住那只破酒盏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要知道，你背着多少责任，你还没有到自怨自艾的时候，你更没有自怨自艾的资格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的胳膊伤了，我的腿也伤了，你我互不相欠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那些碍事的家伙来搅局之前，继续吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一招就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真高啊。平时走在路上，真感觉不出，这座山峰其实这么陡峭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人不该总走在道上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才这一出，已经算是你救了我一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我救的是孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，你还救了孩子。那现在，我还怎么和你分生死呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"树林深处，徒留白雪。二人相望无言。\n忽一声琴鸣，凄凄切切铮铮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来者何人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"令没有说话。她只是静静地盘腿而坐，坐在一块冰冷的石头上。\n风吹斜了夕阳，很快太阳就要落山了。\n这对仇家又重新看向了对方。\n一声琴音，似是从天上传来。可那女子分明没有抱琴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......我们......从那个古怪家伙的手里逃出来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是看来，我们好像还是没有脱离困境哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被自己要挟一把，实在不是什么好体验......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......公子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生何事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我见到那个罪人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果真如那罪人所言，她们如今正在面对她们自我的桎梏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子心有疑虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不明白，太傅为何要相信那罪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她们失败，我们将会在尚蜀直面它的影子。哪怕......只是一小部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台本就打算以此逼白天师出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲是这么期望的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天空！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阴影正汇聚成形......这就是......岁的影子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礼部在尚蜀有青雷伯白定山带队坐镇，只是岁相阴影，掀不起波澜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“岁相”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它......在看什么？"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐忽地感到，岁相正在审视这片土地。\n忽而怀恋，忽而悲愤，忽而怜悯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到微风拂过，这巨大的阴影，只在眨眼之间烟消云散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！消失了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一场大梦，醒了，就消失了呗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你原来......一直能做到这样的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们为了自己的存在殚心竭虑的时候，你随手一拍，就能打碎那个幻象？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生皆梦幻，如露似电，无踪泡影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殊不知你我于它，如罔两于景，似是而非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"化为泡影破灭的，就不能是它吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说得轻巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是很轻巧的一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才是你们的姐姐啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......司岁台需要年和夕给出一个解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，你三人不能共同行动，需在司岁台监视下，离开尚蜀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么啊，这样不就不能在罗德岛搞家庭派对了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想多拉几个人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喂......你认真的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果罗德岛打算引起更多关注......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你相信我所说的，你也许该亲自来看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......关于这件事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我做担保。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麟青砚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惊蛰小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"久违了，克洛丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身边的那位是新的干员吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在、在下乌有，幸会，惊蛰小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大理寺似乎不应插手司岁台事务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是以天师府传人身份，劝师伯给各方留一丝余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪宁小姐始终按兵不动......原来是你先去说服了那位白天师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可天师府何时能为此事做主了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自然不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是眼下，司岁台恐怕也不能妄下定夺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅已至尚蜀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台秉烛人左乐，礼部左侍郎宁辞秋，肃政院副监察御史太合，尚蜀知府梁洵，以及我本人，都须在今夜子时之前，回到梁府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等候太傅指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遵命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年、夕、令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三位也请挪步梁府。太傅想亲自见见你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自上次见他已过了三十年有余，不知今日，他又变化多大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，又来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一场白日梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我知道，这是她们的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那局棋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我们侥幸未输。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是众人合力，对面却只有一人纹枰，终究是不太光彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光彩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与他斗，还谈什么光彩不光彩呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——夜儿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳......你们都这样了还要打！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿！你受伤比我们都重，别逞强！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"郑清钺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么......在最后收了刀？你若没有收刀，就凭一个受了伤的小丫头，拦得住你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又想逃？栽在我手里你就心安了是吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿，你长大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长大了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"琴声毕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"令的身影凭空散去，如音绕梁。这不是什么美梦，“一个小礼”，他是如此说的。\n她现在有了一个问题，一个想要得到答案的问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
